- Great Company Culture;
- Awesome Products;
- Fun Worker Environment;
- Free Quarterly Credit on Top of Below Retail Price to Buy Most of The L'Óreal Lines' Products;
- Quarterly Bonus When Store Made Goal;
- Fun Yet Professional 2 Days Training Seminars;
- Understanding Managers It's still retails back to the end, schedules are not set, always changing, every shift can be a different shifts, can be hard to adjust body clock!

